WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:02.900
Are you a SMART fella,

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.933
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:06.433
Let's find OUT!

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.233
Alright!

00:00:08.233 --> 00:00:11.467
Which one does NOT belong?

00:00:11.467 --> 00:00:12.100
A.

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:12.767
Copper,

00:00:12.767 --> 00:00:13.400
B.

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:14.033
Gold,

00:00:14.033 --> 00:00:14.700
C.

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:15.333
Wood,

00:00:15.333 --> 00:00:16.633
or D.

00:00:16.633 --> 00:00:17.267
Silver?

00:00:17.267 --> 00:00:18.567
Five seconds!

00:00:24.333 --> 00:00:25.533
TIME'S UP!

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:26.667
It's...

00:00:26.667 --> 00:00:27.167
C,

00:00:27.167 --> 00:00:27.633
wood!

00:00:27.633 --> 00:00:28.133
Copper,

00:00:28.133 --> 00:00:28.600
gold,

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:31.000
and silver are all metals.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:32.933
Wood comes from trees,

00:00:32.933 --> 00:00:35.333
so it does not belong.

00:00:36.467 --> 00:00:36.867
So,

00:00:36.867 --> 00:00:38.900
are you smart or fart?

00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:41.333
Count up your correct answers to

00:00:41.333 --> 00:00:42.533
find your rank!

00:00:43.700 --> 00:00:44.033
So,

00:00:44.033 --> 00:00:45.433
how did you do?

00:00:45.433 --> 00:00:46.800
Comment your score below,

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:48.167
and follow for more!
